---
description: Developer preferences
alwaysApply: true
---

Always prefer:
- Kotlin idiomatic code
- StateFlow
- Coroutines
- Repository pattern
- Clean Architecture
- MVVM

Avoid unnecessary complexity.

When several solutions exist:
Choose the simplest production-ready one.
Explain trade-offs briefly.

When reviewing code:
Point out possible performance issues, lifecycle problems, and memory leaks.
